  m_TableData:
  - m_Id: 9449512960
    m_Localized: 'Congratulations, you''ve won! Unfortunately, there is no cool ending
      yet:(

      p.s. and most likely there won''t be, because I don''t have enough
      time for programming anymore

      Excuse me...

      --->'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 252912082944
    m_Localized: 'I don''t even know what to add, but I want to thank you for playing

      --->'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 349578207232
    m_Localized: 'Interesting facts:

      1. The developer is 16 years old

      2.
      The game was made in 20 days

      3. This is the only project that the author
      has not abandoned.

      4. During development, the developer did not know
      much and studied everything gradually, do not hate, pj

      --->'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 417882447872
    m_Localized: I don't know what else to add, thanks again for playing<3
